  ],
  "limits": [
    "Generic non-CGM chart detail controls still use the cloud form and explicit Save; restoring those grouped immediate-save controls remains separate work.",
    "Browser validation uses the real canonical projection and commands through a local HTTP fixture; it does not establish hosted acceptance.",
    "No new same-state phone capture. Saved mobile source and November 8 reference screenshots define presentation."
  ]
